<section class="cx-faq cx-section" id="faq">
  <div class="cx-container">
    <div class="r">
      <div class="cx-eyebrow">Common Questions</div>
      <h2 class="cx-h2">Questions project managers<br>ask before hiring us.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cx-faq-list">
      <div class="cx-faq-item">
        <div class="cx-faq-q">
          <h3>Do you handle permitting?</h3>
          <span class="cx-faq-icon"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cx-faq-a"><p>Yes. We apply for all required permits on day one of the project, manage the permit process, book rough-in and final inspections, and close permits at project completion. Permit delays are built into our schedule assumptions where applicable.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-faq-item">
        <div class="cx-faq-q">
          <h3>What is the typical quote turnaround time?</h3>
          <span class="cx-faq-icon"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cx-faq-a"><p>We return detailed, itemized quotes within five business days of a site visit. For larger or more complex projects, we will tell you upfront if additional time is needed. We do not provide quotes without seeing the space.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-faq-item">
        <div class="cx-faq-q">
          <h3>Can you work in an occupied building?</h3>
          <span class="cx-faq-icon"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cx-faq-a"><p>Yes. We regularly execute renovations in occupied commercial buildings. We coordinate with building management, use proper hoarding and dust containment, schedule noisy work during off-hours where required, and keep common areas clear. For medical projects, we follow ICRA protocols throughout.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-faq-item">
        <div class="cx-faq-q">
          <h3>How do you handle scope changes mid-project?</h3>
          <span class="cx-faq-icon"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cx-faq-a"><p>Every scope change is documented in a formal change order with a cost impact and schedule impact before work proceeds. No verbal approvals, no surprises on the final invoice. You always know what a change will cost before we make it.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-faq-item">
        <div class="cx-faq-q">
          <h3>What geographic areas do you serve?</h3>
          <span class="cx-faq-icon"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cx-faq-a"><p>We operate across the Greater Toronto Area: Toronto, Mississauga, Brampton, Vaughan, Markham, Oakville, Burlington, Hamilton, and surrounding areas. For larger projects, we can mobilize across Ontario. Contact us to discuss your specific location.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-faq-item">
        <div class="cx-faq-q">
          <h3>Do you have WSIB and liability insurance?</h3>
          <span class="cx-faq-icon"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cx-faq-a"><p>Yes. VNG carries full commercial general liability insurance and WSIB clearance. Certificates are provided at contract signing and can be issued to your organization or property management as additional insured.</p></div>
